  # Project Overview
  
  ## What is This Project?
  
  This is the **backend** (server-side) code for an **e-commerce website**. Think of it like the "brain" of an online shopping store. While customers see a website or mobile app (the frontend), this backend does all the important work behind the scenes:
  
  - Managing products and categories
  - Handling customer orders
  - Processing payments and discounts
  - Managing user accounts
  - Storing and retrieving product reviews
  - Managing shopping carts
  - And much more!
  
  ## Key Technologies Used
  
  - **Node.js** - JavaScript runtime to run server code
  - **Express.js** - Framework to handle HTTP requests
  - **MongoDB** - Database to store all data
  - **ImageKit** - Cloud service to store product images
  - **JWT** - Security tokens for user authentication
  - **Multer** - Tool for handling file uploads
  
  ---
  
  # Project Structure
  
  Let me break down where everything is located:
  
  ```
  ecommerce-backend/
  │
  ├── bootstrap.js          ← Starts the application
  ├── index.js              ← Main entry point
  ├── router-handler.js     ← Routes all API requests to correct controller
  ├── package.json          ← List of libraries/dependencies used
  ├── vercel.json           ← Deployment configuration
  │
  ├── DB/                   ← Database related files
  │   ├── connection.js     ← Connects to MongoDB database
  │   ├── global-setup.js   ← Sets up database on startup
  │   └── Models/           ← Database table definitions
  │       ├── user.model.js
  │       ├── product.model.js
  │       ├── category.model.js
  │       ├── brand.model.js
  │       ├── cart.model.js
  │       ├── order.model.js
  │       ├── coupon.model.js
  │       ├── review.model.js
  │       ├── address.model.js
  │       ├── sub-category.model.js
  │       └── index.js      ← Exports all models
  │
  └── src/                  ← Main application code
      ├── Middlewares/      ← Security checks and filters
      │   ├── auth.middleware.js       ← Checks if user is logged in
      │   ├── error-handle.middleware.js ← Handles errors
      │   ├── multer.middleware.js     ← Handles file uploads
      │   ├── search.middleware.js     ← Helps search products
      │   ├── validation.middleware.js ← Checks input data
      │   └── index.js
      │
      ├── Modules/          ← Features grouped by functionality
